  "content": {
    "id": "p34-q14-root",
    "type": "question",
    "label": "14",
    "prompt": "Complete the square for each quadratic function. Hence write each quadratic in factored form. Your answers will involve surds.",
    "layout": "grid",
    "columns": 3,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [
      {
        "id": "p34-q14-a",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "a",
        "prompt": "$f(x)=x^2+2x-1$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$f(x)=(x+1)^2-2$\n\n$f(x)=(x+1+\\sqrt2)(x+1-\\sqrt2)$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}f(x)&=(x^2+2x+1)-1-1\\\\f(x)&=(x+1)^2-2\\\\f(x)&=(x+1)^2-(\\sqrt2)^2\\\\f(x)&=(x+1+\\sqrt2)(x+1-\\sqrt2)\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 44
      },
      {
        "id": "p34-q14-b",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "b",
        "prompt": "$f(x)=x^2-4x+1$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$f(x)=(x-2)^2-3$\n\n$f(x)=(x-2+\\sqrt3)(x-2-\\sqrt3)$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}f(x)&=(x^2-4x+4)-4+1\\\\f(x)&=(x-2)^2-3\\\\f(x)&=(x-2)^2-(\\sqrt3)^2\\\\f(x)&=(x-2+\\sqrt3)(x-2-\\sqrt3)\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 44
      },
      {
        "id": "p34-q14-c",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "c",
        "prompt": "$f(x)=-x^2-2x+4$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$f(x)=-(x+1)^2+5$\n\n$f(x)=-(x+1+\\sqrt5)(x+1-\\sqrt5)$",
          "worked": "Divide through by $-1$, complete the square, then restore $f(x)$.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}-f(x)&=x^2+2x-4\\\\-f(x)&=(x^2+2x+1)-1-4\\\\-f(x)&=(x+1)^2-5\\\\f(x)&=-(x+1)^2+5\\\\f(x)&=-\\bigl((x+1)^2-(\\sqrt5)^2\\bigr)\\\\f(x)&=-(x+1+\\sqrt5)(x+1-\\sqrt5)\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 60
      }
    ]
